index 4479b53..79250a8 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -2,6 +2,14 @@
 
 This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.
 
+Navigation retains up to five recent views (including the active view) in a
+persistent main container. Inactive views use `content-visibility: hidden`,
+`inert`, and `aria-hidden`; browsers without content visibility fall back to
+`display: none`. Returning to a cached pathname and query restores its existing
+DOM and component state. The router still fetches the destination for page
+metadata and navigation behavior. Same-URL navigations refresh the view, and
+sign-in/sign-up forms opt out with the layout's `cacheView={false}` prop.
+
 
 ```sh
 pnpm install && pnpm run start
